{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misoalertstatus"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOAlertStatus\/accent(image:)","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOAlertStatus\/info","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOAlertStatus\/negative","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOAlertStatus\/neutral(image:)","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOAlertStatus\/positive","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOAlertStatus\/warning"],"anchor":"Enumeration-Cases","title":"Enumeration Cases"}],"kind":"symbol","relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOAlertStatus"},"metadata":{"externalID":"s:14MISOComponents15MISOAlertStatusO","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOAlertStatus"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOAlertStatus"}],"title":"MISOAlertStatus","modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"symbolKind":"enum","platforms":[{"introducedAt":"15.0","name":"iOS","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"introducedAt":"13.0","name":"macOS","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"introducedAt":"16.0","name":"tvOS","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"introducedAt":"1.0","name":"visionOS","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"introducedAt":"11.0","name":"watchOS","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"beta":false}],"roleHeading":"Enumeration"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"text":"The status of the alerts.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOAlertMessage","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" background color and its icon color are based on this status.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOInlineAlert","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" icon and text color are based on this status.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@frozen"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOAlertStatus"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"There are two types of statuses:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Non-functional statuses used for informational or decorative alert messages.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"They provide context or highlight content without implying a specific state, system event, or user action.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"These alerts are not tied to UX patterns such as success, error, or warning, and may use contextual or brand-related icons to enhance recognition or storytelling.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Functional statuses communicate specific system statuses, results, or user feedback:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Each variant conveys a clear semantic meaning and must always be paired with its dedicated functional icon to ensure clarity and accessibility.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Use functional alerts to inform user about state changes, confirmations, or issues that are directly connected to system logic or user actions.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"These messages carry functional meaning and help guide user response or acknowledgment.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISOAlertStatus/info":{"fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"info"}],"url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misoalertstatus\/info","title":"MISOAlertStatus.info","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOAlertStatus\/info","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Info status is used to share neutral system information or service updates that do not require immediate action. Ideal for background processes or status"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"messages where users simply need to stay informed."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This status displays a dedicated default icon."}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISOAlertStatus/neutral(image:)":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Neutral status can be used as a generic informative alert without semantic meaning or colour association."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Suitable for a wide range of contexts — such as tips, general information, or descriptive labels — where"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"no specific feedback or urgency is required. Appropriate for help sections, dashboards, or onboarding flows."}],"url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misoalertstatus\/neutral(image:)","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"MISOAlertStatus.neutral(image:)","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"neutral"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14MISOComponents9MISOImageV","text":"MISOImage"},{"kind":"text","text":"?)"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOAlertStatus\/neutral(image:)"},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISOAlertStatus/positive":{"url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misoalertstatus\/positive","type":"topic","title":"MISOAlertStatus.positive","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Positive status indicates that a task or process has been completed successfully. These alerts reassure users and confirm that no further action is needed."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This status displays a dedicated default icon."}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"positive","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOAlertStatus\/positive"},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISOInlineAlert":{"url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misoinlinealert","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Inline alert is a lightweight UI element, placed in the content flow, that displays information, system feedback,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"status changes throughout short, prominent, persistent and non actionable communication. Inline alert includes functional","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"icon and semantic colour, and does not include a close button and\/or action link. Inline alert does not disappear and remains visible.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOInlineAlert"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOInlineAlert"}],"title":"MISOInlineAlert","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOInlineAlert","kind":"symbol"},"ic_folder_categories.png":{"type":"image","identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png","variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/MISOComponents\/ic_folder_categories.png"}],"alt":null},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISOAlertStatus":{"type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MISOAlertStatus","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misoalertstatus","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOAlertStatus","role":"symbol","title":"MISOAlertStatus","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The status of the alerts."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOAlertMessage","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" background color and its icon color are based on this status.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOInlineAlert","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" icon and text color are based on this status."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOAlertStatus"}]},"doc://MISOComponents/s8SendableP":{"type":"unresolvable","title":"Swift.Sendable","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s8SendableP"},"doc://MISOComponents/s16SendableMetatypeP":{"type":"unresolvable","title":"Swift.SendableMetatype","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP"},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents":{"role":"collection","images":[{"identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png","type":"icon"}],"url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents","kind":"symbol","title":"Components","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The catalog of all components provided by MISO. It contains also "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View"},{"type":"text","text":" extensions and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ViewModifiers"},{"type":"text","text":" to apply tokens and styles on components and higher-level views. These are inherited from OUDS."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents","type":"topic"},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISOAlertMessage":{"url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misoalertmessage","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Alert message is a UI element that displays system feedback, status changes or required action; throughout detailed, prominent, persistent and actionable"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"communication. Alert message includes functional icon and semantic colour, and may include as well a close button and\/or action link."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Alert Message does not disappear automatically and remains visible until dismissed or resolved by the user."}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MISOAlertMessage","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOAlertMessage"}],"title":"MISOAlertMessage","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOAlertMessage","type":"topic"},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISOAlertStatus/negative":{"title":"MISOAlertStatus.negative","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOAlertStatus\/negative","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Negative status communicates a critical issue or error that prevents the user from proceeding until it is resolved. These alerts remain visible until","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the problem is fixed or dismissed by the user.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This status displays a dedicated default icon.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misoalertstatus\/negative","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"negative"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISOAlertStatus/warning":{"type":"topic","title":"MISOAlertStatus.warning","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Used to draw attention to potential issues or upcoming changes that might affect the user’s service or experience. Warnings encourage awareness but"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"typically do not block actions."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This status displays a dedicated default icon."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"warning"}],"url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misoalertstatus\/warning","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOAlertStatus\/warning","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol"},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISOAlertStatus/accent(image:)":{"abstract":[{"text":"Accent status uses brand colours to draw attention to promotional or highlighted information while remaining non-critical. Ideal for marketing content,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"announcements, or feature highlights, where you want to subtly engage users without introducing functional semantics. Ideal for promotional banners,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"product updates, or customer engagement moments.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOAlertStatus\/accent(image:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"accent"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14MISOComponents9MISOImageV","text":"MISOImage"},{"kind":"text","text":"?)"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misoalertstatus\/accent(image:)","title":"MISOAlertStatus.accent(image:)"}}}